  "body": "**Suggestion**\r\n_What would you like to see in Matrix? If your idea is vaguely complete enough, we\r\nrecommend submitting [an MSC](https://matrix.org/docs/spec/proposals) instead._\r\n\r\nThis would be the ability for a server admin to suggest users to join a room, like an status or announcement room. The only difference between this and the autojoin feature is that a user can freely choose whether they want to join the room or not instead of forcing them (even though they can leave later). _This would essentially function like an invite, just that it's automatic, and that it's a private invite and nobody in the room is notified._\r\n\r\nThis is mostly for privacy improvement, since some people may not wish for other people to know of the existence of their account.",
